# Heroku builds the agent worker (agent/) from this repository. The website's static assets, tests, docs, SQL and scripts are not needed by the worker dyno.
# (No *.md rule: agent/prompts/system.md is the agent's system prompt and must stay in the slug.)
# Every rule starts with "/" (root only): unanchored, gitignore-like rules can match a directory of the same name at any depth (src/lib/supabase/,
# agent/scripts/). tests/heroku-slugignore-build.test.ts refuses an unanchored rule.
/public/
/tests/
/docs/
/supabase/
/scripts/
